meta:
  origin:
    producer: Centers for Disease Control and Prevention
    title: Historical polio deaths in the United States – Centers for Disease Control and Prevention
    description: |-
      Data on historical polio deaths in the United States, compiled from a selection of sources from the US CDC.

      From 1950, these are deaths with acute poliomyelitis as the underlying cause on the death certificate, from the National Center for Health Statistics' death records (ICD-7 code 080 until 1967; ICD-8, ICD-9 and ICD-10 codes after that). In the years checked (1950-1967 and 1999-2025), deaths from the late effects of polio are not included.

      Sources for each year are as follows:

      * 1950-1959: [Morbidity and Mortality Weekly Report Vol. 9, No. 53, Annual Supplement: Reported Incidence of Notifiable Diseases in the United States, 1960 (1961), Table 3A](https://www.globalhealthchronicles.org/items/show/6303)

      * 1960-1967: [Morbidity and Mortality Weekly Report Vol. 19, No. 53, Annual Supplement: Summary 1970 (1971), Table 3A](https://stacks.cdc.gov/view/cdc/951)

      * 1968-1978: [Compressed Mortality, 1968-1978 - CDC WONDER (ICD-8)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/cmf-icd8.html)

      * 1979-1998: [Compressed Mortality, 1979-1998 - CDC WONDER (ICD-9)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/cmf-icd9.html)

      * 1999-2020: [Underlying Cause of Death, 1999-2020 - CDC WONDER (ICD-10)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/ucd-icd10.html)

      * 2018-2023: [Underlying Cause of Death by Single-Race Categories - CDC WONDER (ICD-10)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/deaths-by-underlying-cause.html)

      * 2024: [Underlying Cause of Death, 2018-2024, Single Race - CDC WONDER (ICD-10)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/ucd-icd10-expanded.html)

      * 2025: [Provisional Mortality Statistics, 2018 through Last Week - CDC WONDER (ICD-10)](https://wonder.cdc.gov/mcd-icd10-provisional.html). This count is provisional and can still be revised.

      From 1999, deaths are those with acute poliomyelitis (ICD-10 code A80) as the underlying cause of death.
    citation_full: |-
      Morbidity and Mortality Weekly Report Vol. 9, No. 53, Annual Supplement: Reported Incidence of Notifiable Diseases in the United States, 1960 (1961), Communicable Disease Center, Public Health Service, U.S. Department of Health, Education, and Welfare.

